      "text": "Polysemanticity occurs when a single neuron or unit in a neural network activates in response to multiple, unrelated concepts. This phenomenon complicates mechanistic interpretability because it makes it difficult to assign a discrete, human-understandable meaning to individual components of a model. Understanding polysemanticity is critical for researchers attempting to 'decode' how AI models make decisions and for ensuring model safety."
